---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header3 from '../components/Header3.astro';
import Footer2 from '../components/Footer2.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Story | Family-Owned Mexican Restaurant, Germantown" description="On Century Boulevard since 2015, owned and run by the Rivas brothers. Handmade tortillas, six-hour birria, a family kitchen." canonical="https://senortequilas.com/our-story" ogImage="/images/5ac1271d5937960b.jpg">
<div class="sc-host" data-sc-name="Concept 1 Pages" data-dc-tpl="42"><div data-dc-tpl="6" data-c1p-root="" data-uid="c1pz703u0" style="color: rgb(234, 226, 214); font-family: Barlow, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: rgb(18, 18, 16); min-height: 100%;"><Header3 /><section data-dc-tpl="116" data-screen-label="Story hero" style="position: relative; min-height: clamp(480px, 72vh, 820px); display: flex; align-items: flex-end; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(10, 10, 9);">
  <img data-dc-tpl="117" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/5ac1271d5937960b.jpg" alt="The Rivas brothers" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 30%;">
  <div data-dc-tpl="118" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.5) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.1) 35%, rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.88) 75%, rgb(18, 18, 16) 100%);"></div>
  <div data-dc-tpl="119" style="position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 1180px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 120px clamp(18px, 4.6vw, 48px) clamp(32px, 6vh, 64px);">
    <div data-dc-tpl="120" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133);"><span data-dc-tpl="121" style="width: 26px; height: 1px; background: rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.6);"></span>The Rivas Brothers · Since 2015</div>
    <h1 data-dc-tpl="122" style="color: rgb(246, 239, 228); font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.6vw, 5.5rem); line-height: 0.94; letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 14px 0px 0px; text-transform: uppercase; text-wrap: balance; max-width: 17ch;">We're Not a Chain. <span data-dc-tpl="123" style="color: rgb(185, 156, 102);">We're a Family.</span></h1>
    <p data-dc-tpl="124" style="font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 18px); line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.85); max-width: 56ch; margin: 16px 0px 0px; text-wrap: pretty;">Señor Tequila's has been on Century Boulevard since 2015, owned and run by the Rivas brothers.</p>
  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl="125" data-screen-label="Story intro" style="background: rgb(18, 18, 16); padding: clamp(40px, 7vw, 88px) 0px;">
  <div data-dc-tpl="126" style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px clamp(18px, 4.6vw, 48px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 72px); align-items: start;">
    <blockquote data-dc-tpl="127" style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.15; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(246, 239, 228); text-wrap: balance;">"Mexican food. Not Mexican-style food."<footer data-dc-tpl="128" style="font-family: Barlow, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133); margin-top: 14px;">The house rule</footer></blockquote>
    <div data-dc-tpl="129" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.85); text-wrap: pretty;">
      <p data-dc-tpl="130" style="margin: 0px;">The Rivas brothers opened Señor Tequila's on Century Blvd in 2015 with a short menu and a long list of things they refused to shortcut: tortillas pressed each morning, salsas roasted over flame, birria braised until it gives up.</p>
      <p data-dc-tpl="131" style="margin: 0px;">The room is bigger now and the bar is brand new, and the rule has not moved. Germantown made this place its cantina, lotería on Wednesdays, karaoke on Thursdays, mariachi with Sunday dinner, and we still run it as a family. <em data-dc-tpl="132" style="color: rgb(214, 188, 133);">¡Con mucho gusto!</em></p>
    </div>
  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl="133" data-screen-label="Timeline" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(14, 14, 13, 0.78), rgba(10, 10, 9, 0.9)), url(/images/86475be0134bfc90.png) center center / cover no-repeat; border-top: 1px solid rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.2); padding: clamp(44px, 7vw, 88px) 0px;">
  <div data-dc-tpl="134" style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px clamp(18px, 4.6vw, 48px);">
    <div data-dc-tpl="135" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133);"><span data-dc-tpl="136" style="width: 26px; height: 1px; background: rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.6);"></span>Eleven years, one block</div>
    <h2 data-dc-tpl="137" style="color: rgb(246, 239, 228); font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 5.5vw, 46px); line-height: 1.02; margin: 8px 0px 0px; text-transform: uppercase;">Yes, We Know Where We’re Sitting</h2>
    <div data-dc-tpl="138" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 230px), 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 26px;">
      
        <div data-dc-tpl="140" style="background: rgb(28, 27, 24); border: 1px solid rgb(42, 40, 32); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div data-dc-tpl="141" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background: url(/images/5e8f15f4ebe2842c.jpg) center center / cover no-repeat rgb(35, 33, 28);"></div>
          <div data-dc-tpl="142" style="padding: 16px 18px 18px;"><div data-dc-tpl="143" style="font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; color: rgb(56, 176, 73); line-height: 1;"><span class="sc-interp">2015</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="144" style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 8px; color: rgb(246, 239, 228);"><span class="sc-interp">Two brothers, one dining room</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="145" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.8); margin-top: 6px;"><span class="sc-interp">The Rivas brothers open the doors on Century Boulevard.</span></div></div>
        </div>
      
    </div>
  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl="146" data-screen-label="The brothers" style="background: rgb(20, 18, 16); border-top: 1px solid rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.2); padding: clamp(44px, 7vw, 88px) 0px;">
  <div data-dc-tpl="147" style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px clamp(18px, 4.6vw, 48px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px); align-items: center;">
    <div data-dc-tpl="148">
      <div data-dc-tpl="149" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133);"><span data-dc-tpl="150" style="width: 26px; height: 1px; background: rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.6);"></span>La familia</div>
      <h2 data-dc-tpl="151" style="color: rgb(246, 239, 228); font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 5.5vw, 46px); line-height: 1.02; margin: 8px 0px 0px; text-transform: uppercase;">Mexican, Not Mexican-Style</h2>
      <p data-dc-tpl="152" style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.85); margin: 14px 0px 0px; max-width: 50ch; text-wrap: pretty;">Still on the floor most nights. One runs the room, one runs the kitchen, both will pull up a chair if you ask about the mezcal. <span data-dc-tpl="153" style="color: rgb(185, 156, 102);">[Names, roles and short bios pending from the client]</span></p>
    </div>
    <div data-dc-tpl="154" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px;">
      
        <div data-dc-tpl="156" style="position: relative; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(28, 27, 24); border: 1px solid rgb(42, 40, 32);"><img data-dc-tpl="157" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/5ac1271d5937960b.jpg" alt="A molcajete of flank steak, chicken and chorizo under salsa verde" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.9;"><div data-dc-tpl="158" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; background: linear-gradient(transparent 50%, rgba(10, 10, 9, 0.9));"></div><div data-dc-tpl="159" style="position: absolute; left: 14px; right: 14px; bottom: 12px;"><div data-dc-tpl="160" style="font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(246, 239, 228);"><span class="sc-interp">The Rivas Brothers</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="161" style="font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133); margin-top: 2px;"><span class="sc-interp">The room</span></div></div></div>
      
        <div data-dc-tpl="156" style="position: relative; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(28, 27, 24); border: 1px solid rgb(42, 40, 32);"><img data-dc-tpl="157" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/5ac1271d5937960b.jpg" alt="A molcajete of flank steak, chicken and chorizo under salsa verde" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.9;"><div data-dc-tpl="158" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; background: linear-gradient(transparent 50%, rgba(10, 10, 9, 0.9));"></div><div data-dc-tpl="159" style="position: absolute; left: 14px; right: 14px; bottom: 12px;"><div data-dc-tpl="160" style="font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(246, 239, 228);"><span class="sc-interp">The Rivas Brothers</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="161" style="font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133); margin-top: 2px;"><span class="sc-interp">The kitchen</span></div></div></div>
      
    </div>
  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl="162" data-screen-label="La cocina / chef" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(70, 8, 14, 0.66), rgba(40, 4, 8, 0.82)), url(/images/ecf6382a259b5884.png) center center / cover no-repeat; border-top: 1px solid rgba(191, 30, 46, 0.3); padding: clamp(44px, 7vw, 88px) 0px;">
  <div data-dc-tpl="163" style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px clamp(18px, 4.6vw, 48px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px); align-items: center;">
    <div data-dc-tpl="164" style="position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(28, 27, 24); border: 1px solid rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.3);">
      <img data-dc-tpl="165" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/562378eecadc3da2.jpg" alt="The chef" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.85;">
    </div>
    <div data-dc-tpl="166">
      <div data-dc-tpl="167" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133);"><span data-dc-tpl="168" style="width: 26px; height: 1px; background: rgba(214, 188, 133, 0.7);"></span>La cocina · 2026</div>
      <h2 data-dc-tpl="169" style="color: rgb(246, 239, 228); font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 5.5vw, 46px); line-height: 1.02; margin: 8px 0px 0px; text-transform: uppercase; text-wrap: balance;">Come for Dinner. Stay for the Night.</h2>
      <p data-dc-tpl="170" style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.85); margin: 14px 0px 0px; max-width: 50ch; text-wrap: pretty;">The brothers opened the doors in 2015 with one idea: cook the food they grew up on, no shortcuts. A decade in, the room has grown, but the kitchen still runs the same way.</p>
      <p data-dc-tpl="171" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.8); margin: 12px 0px 20px; max-width: 50ch;">Meet the kitchen behind it, on the floor most nights alongside the family.</p>
      <div data-dc-tpl="172" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;">
        <a data-dc-tpl="173" href="/menu" class="scp2" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgb(56, 176, 73); color: rgb(12, 18, 13); font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; padding: 15px 22px; border-radius: 12px; min-height: 52px; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: rgba(56, 176, 73, 0.32) 0px 0px 30px;">See the Menu</a>
        <a data-dc-tpl="174" href="https://tables.toasttab.com/restaurants/d94fa749-fbd5-4a66-90b6-d7755b8c3af3/findTime" target="_blank" class="scp9" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1.5px solid rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.75); color: rgb(234, 226, 214); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; padding: 15px 22px; border-radius: 12px; min-height: 52px; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.4);">Reserve a Table</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section><section data-dc-tpl="175" data-screen-label="Three pillars" style="background: rgb(18, 18, 16); border-top: 1px solid rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.2); padding: clamp(44px, 7vw, 88px) 0px;">
  <div data-dc-tpl="176" style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 0px clamp(18px, 4.6vw, 48px);">
    <h2 data-dc-tpl="177" style="color: rgb(246, 239, 228); font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 5.5vw, 46px); line-height: 1.02; margin: 0px; text-transform: uppercase;">Come for Dinner. Stay for the Night.</h2>
    <div data-dc-tpl="178" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 24px;">
      
        <div data-dc-tpl="180" style="position: relative; min-height: 260px; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgb(42, 40, 32); background: url(/images/24e322da4fd1060e.jpg) center center / cover no-repeat rgb(28, 27, 24); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 22px;"><div data-dc-tpl="181" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.05), rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.94) 70%);"></div><div data-dc-tpl="182" style="position: relative;"><div data-dc-tpl="183" style="font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133);"><span class="sc-interp">Folklore</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="184" style="font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.05; margin-top: 6px; color: rgb(246, 239, 228);"><span class="sc-interp">The culture</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="185" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.85); margin-top: 8px;"><span class="sc-interp">Lotería, mariachi, luchador masks on the wall. Mexico as it is, not a theme.</span></div></div></div>
      
        <div data-dc-tpl="180" style="position: relative; min-height: 260px; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgb(42, 40, 32); background: url(/images/9120a505c92f1281.jpg) center center / cover no-repeat rgb(28, 27, 24); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 22px;"><div data-dc-tpl="181" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.05), rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.94) 70%);"></div><div data-dc-tpl="182" style="position: relative;"><div data-dc-tpl="183" style="font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133);"><span class="sc-interp">Kitchen</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="184" style="font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.05; margin-top: 6px; color: rgb(246, 239, 228);"><span class="sc-interp">The food</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="185" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.85); margin-top: 8px;"><span class="sc-interp">Tortillas pressed daily. Birria braised six hours. Pulps cooked, not poured.</span></div></div></div>
      
        <div data-dc-tpl="180" style="position: relative; min-height: 260px; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgb(42, 40, 32); background: url(&quot;https://senortequilas.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Margaritas.jpg&quot;) center center / cover no-repeat rgb(28, 27, 24); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 22px;"><div data-dc-tpl="181" style="position: absolute; inset: 0px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.05), rgba(18, 18, 16, 0.94) 70%);"></div><div data-dc-tpl="182" style="position: relative;"><div data-dc-tpl="183" style="font-family: &quot;Barlow Condensed&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(214, 188, 133);"><span class="sc-interp">Cantina</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="184" style="font-family: &quot;Archivo Black&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.05; margin-top: 6px; color: rgb(246, 239, 228);"><span class="sc-interp">The bar</span></div><div data-dc-tpl="185" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.85); margin-top: 8px;"><span class="sc-interp">Sixty-plus tequilas and mezcals, margaritas by the glass or the 54-ounce Big Mami.</span></div></div></div>
      
    </div>
  </div></section><Footer2 /></div></div>
</Base>
